  multinomial-setdata: dec-B640. A multinomial sampler takes $setData,
    the new data object's n x K count matrix giving the response and
    the number of rows free, as a binomial sampler does (dec-B628). The
    whole-data replacement runs over each category forest and its saved
    draws, and the softmax combiner's per-row state and borrowed counts,
    trials, offset and weights are resized and re-pointed; the BCF
    sampler keeps refusing it. About 200 engine, 40 bridge, 20 R and
