  sbc-band-multiplicity: every arm of benchmarks/R/sbc.R flags a
    functional outside its own 5% ecdf band, uncorrected, so a correct
    sampler flags at least one of an arm's seven functionals with
    probability up to 0.30 (the frequency arm's referee, 2026-11-07).
    Decide a family-wise rule for all arms (alpha / number of
    functionals, or a simultaneous band over them), with each arm's
